Original AgentsWar fighter sound designs. Procedurally rendered PCM WAV, not voice recordings or third-party game samples. Each fighter has two variations for contact, heavy contact, swing, power, block, charge and footstep. Volt: electric discharge. Titan: metal/stone. Nyx: blade/cloth. Pyra: fire. Aegis: resonant barrier. Glitch: gated plasma. Kaiju: low body/debris. Oracle: airy harmonic pulses.
